1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,620
Stop using one chat for 3 weeks.

2
00:00:02,830 --> 00:00:05,830
But that chat knows me. We've been through things.

3
00:00:06,030 --> 00:00:09,400
It's 400 messages long. It's forgetting the early ones.

4
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:10,270
It forgets?

5
00:00:10,470 --> 00:00:14,590
Every model can only hold so much. Your first instructions fade.

6
00:00:14,790 --> 00:00:16,120
So we're too close?

7
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:20,070
Because it's too long. Ask for a summary, start fresh.

8
00:00:20,270 --> 00:00:22,610
A summary of our 3 weeks. Romantic.

9
00:00:22,810 --> 00:00:25,810
Paste it into a new chat. Sharp again.

10
00:00:26,010 --> 00:00:29,670
Side hustle 49: breaking up with a chat every 3 weeks.

